WEBVTT

00:00:04.159 --> 00:00:05.813
[GRUNTING]

00:00:08.163 --> 00:00:11.470
[PANTING]

00:00:11.514 --> 00:00:12.559
[YELLS] [TIGRESS GRUNTS]

00:00:14.909 --> 00:00:16.301
This isn't going to work.

00:00:16.345 --> 00:00:17.694
It has to.

00:00:17.738 --> 00:00:18.782
You're not
thinking straight.

00:00:18.826 --> 00:00:20.218
I am! You're not.

00:00:20.262 --> 00:00:21.263
I am! No.

00:00:21.306 --> 00:00:22.612
Yes, I am.No.

00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:24.483
[GRUNTS] I've seen Kai.

00:00:24.527 --> 00:00:26.529
I've seen what he can do.

00:00:26.573 --> 00:00:28.452
But he hasn't seen
what I can do.

00:00:32.317 --> 00:00:33.932
The Wuxi Finger Hold?

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.625
It's my best move.

00:00:35.669 --> 00:00:37.105
I just have to get to Kai,

00:00:37.148 --> 00:00:38.672
grab his finger
and then skadoosh!

00:00:38.715 --> 00:00:40.325
Back to the Spirit Realm.
[GROANS]

00:00:40.369 --> 00:00:42.066
He has an army
of jade warriors.

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:43.981
Everything they see,
he sees.

00:00:44.025 --> 00:00:45.635
So there's no
sneaking up on him.

00:00:45.679 --> 00:00:46.767
[GROANS] You will never get

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.072
close enough. It's gonna work!

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:53.521
He can only be stopped
by a master of chi.

00:00:53.555 --> 00:00:55.906
Oh, you sound just like Shifu
with the, "Chi, chi, chi."

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.865
"Chi this. Chi that."
"Chi, chi, chi!"

00:00:57.908 --> 00:01:00.258
I'm not a master
of chi, okay?

00:01:00.302 --> 00:01:01.651
I don't know if I'm
the Dragon Warrior.

00:01:01.695 --> 00:01:03.174
I don't even know
if I'm a panda!

00:01:03.218 --> 00:01:04.262
I don't know who I am!

00:01:07.352 --> 00:01:08.789
You're right.

00:01:08.832 --> 00:01:10.838
There's no way
I can stop him and his army.

00:01:15.186 --> 00:01:17.188
LI: Unless you had
an army of your own.

00:01:20.583 --> 00:01:21.913
You?

00:01:22.324 --> 00:01:23.760
Not just me.

00:01:23.804 --> 00:01:25.501
Us.

00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:26.589
All of us.

00:01:36.512 --> 00:01:41.212
I finally found my son,
after all these years.

00:01:41.256 --> 00:01:43.432
It's going to take a lot more
than the end of the world...

00:01:43.475 --> 00:01:44.825
to keep us apart.

00:01:44.868 --> 00:01:46.740
But you don't even
know kung fu.

00:01:46.783 --> 00:01:49.438
Then you will teach us.

00:01:49.481 --> 00:01:52.397
What? I can't
teach you kung fu.

00:01:52.441 --> 00:01:57.968
I couldn't even teach Tigress.
And she already knows kung fu!

00:01:58.012 --> 00:02:02.767
Po, I know I'm the last guy
you wanna trust right now.

00:02:03.539 --> 00:02:04.845
But you gotta believe me.

00:02:04.888 --> 00:02:06.716
We can do this.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.936
We can learn kung fu.

00:02:08.979 --> 00:02:11.732
We can be just like you!

00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:14.811
What did you just say?
Uh...

00:02:14.855 --> 00:02:16.383
"We can do this"?
No!

00:02:16.987 --> 00:02:18.772
"We can learn kung fu"?
After that!

00:02:18.815 --> 00:02:20.034
Uh... "We can be
just like you"?

00:02:20.077 --> 00:02:21.513
Yes! We can?

00:02:21.557 --> 00:02:23.254
No! You can't!

00:02:23.298 --> 00:02:24.691
[LAUGHING]

00:02:24.734 --> 00:02:26.458
But you don't have to be!

00:02:27.432 --> 00:02:28.912
That's what Shifu meant.

00:02:28.956 --> 00:02:30.609
I don't have to
turn you into me.

00:02:30.653 --> 00:02:32.373
I have to turn
you into you!

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.701
That doesn't
make any sense.

00:02:34.744 --> 00:02:36.659
I know! [LAUGHS]

00:02:36.703 --> 00:02:38.313
Thanks, Dads.

00:02:38.356 --> 00:02:40.228
BOTH: You're welcome?

00:02:40.271 --> 00:02:42.796
I'm gonna do something
I never thought I'd be able to do.

00:02:42.839 --> 00:02:44.667
I'm gonna teach kung fu.

00:02:47.539 --> 00:02:49.716
You guys, your real strength
comes from being

00:02:49.759 --> 00:02:51.124
the best "you" you can be.

00:02:51.147 --> 00:02:52.457
So who are you?

00:02:52.501 --> 00:02:53.763
What are you good at?
[GRUNTING]

00:02:53.807 --> 00:02:55.504
What do you love?

00:02:55.547 --> 00:02:57.593
What makes you, "you"? Whoo-hoo!

00:02:57.636 --> 00:02:58.768
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:02:58.812 --> 00:03:02.098
Yes, good. Good. Again.

00:03:04.992 --> 00:03:06.167
Good. Again.

00:03:07.429 --> 00:03:09.080
Good, good, good. Again.

00:03:10.649 --> 00:03:12.390
Stripy Baby! Stripy Baby!

00:03:14.175 --> 00:03:16.699
Faster, faster!
Twirl those ribbons!

00:03:16.743 --> 00:03:18.135
Hug that log, you!
[GRUNTING]

00:03:18.179 --> 00:03:20.050
Hug that log
like it's the last time

00:03:20.094 --> 00:03:22.052
you're ever gonna hug it
goodbye forever.

00:03:22.096 --> 00:03:23.445
Higher! And a little more
to the left this time.

00:03:23.488 --> 00:03:24.489
You can do it!

00:03:24.533 --> 00:03:26.361
Whoo-hoo!

00:03:26.404 --> 00:03:28.058
BOTH: Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:03:28.102 --> 00:03:29.799
I don't wanna see
any of these hit the ground!

00:03:30.234 --> 00:03:31.401
[YELLS]

00:03:32.933 --> 00:03:35.239
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.770
Wait, wait, Stripy Baby!

00:03:43.813 --> 00:03:46.188
[GRUNTING]
Good! Try it with this.

00:03:46.468 --> 00:03:47.904
[PO WHISTLES]

00:03:47.948 --> 00:03:50.037
Now try it with these!

00:03:54.606 --> 00:03:56.677
Good!
Now try it with these.

00:03:59.873 --> 00:04:01.570
Oh! Oh![GROANS]

00:04:01.613 --> 00:04:03.398
[GRUNTS][GROANING]

00:04:03.441 --> 00:04:05.139
[LAUGHING]

00:04:06.618 --> 00:04:07.706
[GROANING]

00:04:16.977 --> 00:04:18.587
[GRUNTING]

00:04:28.727 --> 00:04:29.772
BOTH: Whoo! [GRUNT]

00:04:31.034 --> 00:04:32.296
They are ready.

00:04:33.471 --> 00:04:34.472
[LEI LEI COOING]

00:04:35.082 --> 00:04:37.305
What?

00:04:37.329 --> 00:04:39.434
Okay, pay attention because
I'm only gonna go over this

00:04:39.477 --> 00:04:41.044
ten more times.

00:04:41.088 --> 00:04:44.091
The only entrance
to the village is here.

00:04:44.134 --> 00:04:46.484
The dumpling squadron
will take position here...

00:04:46.528 --> 00:04:48.539
while the cookie squadron
will take position here.

00:04:48.623 --> 00:04:51.141
Now, on my signal,
the two squadrons will...

00:04:53.927 --> 00:04:55.754
Right, okay. [ALL LAUGHING]

00:04:55.798 --> 00:04:57.243
The noodle squadron will... [SLURPING]

00:05:00.716 --> 00:05:02.761
[LAUGHING CONTINUES]

00:05:02.805 --> 00:05:04.763
Okay. Anyway,
the important thing to remember

00:05:04.807 --> 00:05:05.895
is that this is the spot
where...

00:05:05.939 --> 00:05:07.105
[GASPS]

00:05:09.029 --> 00:05:11.074
Okay, I saw that coming.

00:05:11.118 --> 00:05:12.597
If you only remember
one thing,

00:05:12.641 --> 00:05:14.138
it's distract the jombies...

00:05:14.172 --> 00:05:16.993
until I get close enough to
put a Wuxi Finger Hold on Kai.

00:05:17.037 --> 00:05:18.516
You got it?
ALL: Yeah!

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.040
[ALL CHEERING]

00:05:20.083 --> 00:05:22.346
Pandas on three!
One, two three, Pan...!

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:25.219
You guys... Never mind,
I'll teach you that later.

